<svg class="figure-wide" viewBox="0 0 660 392" role="img" aria-label="tower at a glance. The operator writes one config file and deploys it to a Cloudflare account, so there is no server to keep. Inside the account the page Worker serves the public page and /api/status with names only, and takes POST /beat from your jobs and POST /relay from alert sources. It calls the prober over RPC. The prober keeps history in D1, probes the watched services from outside, and mails the inbox DOWN, UP, FIRING and RESOLVED alerts plus a daily digest. The two Workers watch each other." xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
